{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Spirit</strong>, a manta ray whose search for crystals has lead him to traverse all kinds of areas. <strong>Collect</strong> all the crystals and <strong>explore</strong> all 35 levels in this <strong>3D platformer reminiscent</strong> of the glorious platformer days.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spin, jump and BREAK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Spirit's moveset to slay enemies, break rocks with incapsulated crystals while traversing the different levels navigating precise platforming and unforeseen danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore varying level with\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different levels will naturally bring different challenges! Some require precise platforming, some require fast reactions and some might require you to pay close attention to detail...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022230?t=1761520299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022230/6f635cc0a4e62314742f217a19e81b8bb0f3b343/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761520299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022230/a713e2373660205d92df85374fb1fa589dd6bd6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761520299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022230/a713e2373660205d92df85374fb1fa589dd6bd6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761520299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Spirit</strong>, a manta ray whose search for crystals has lead him to traverse all kinds of areas. <strong>Collect</stron